#: ../../api/connecting.md:106 0e8c35eb80454282bdc16b5b31690554
msgid ""
"The sweep and batch ceilings are also published in `Capabilities`, so a "
"client can refuse a too-large request before spending the round trip."
msgstr "掃描與批次的上限也會公布在 `Capabilities` 裡，因此用戶端可以在花掉一趟往返之前，就先拒絕過大的請求。"

#: ../../api/connecting.md:109 05c6b59945c44011b002b4cca8ffaa97
msgid "Liveness without the protocol"
msgstr "不走協定的存活檢查"

#: ../../api/connecting.md:111 ba242a41a1b34828a0ef5b35749ef50f
msgid ""
"`GET /healthz` answers over plain HTTP for a proxy or an orchestrator "
"that cannot speak this protocol:"
msgstr "`GET /healthz` 以純 HTTP 回應，供無法使用這套協定的代理伺服器或編排器使用："

#: ../../api/connecting.md:119 bbe9a7689abb46b0a59331fade4d6e00
msgid ""
"It proves the event loop is turning, which is the honest scope of a "
"liveness check. It says nothing about whether a particular session is "
"healthy."
msgstr "它證明事件迴圈還在轉，這正是存活檢查誠實的範圍。至於某個特定工作階段是否健康，它什麼也沒說。"

